{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "4165e5cfe76e116112cd0017cbc428460e59ba668a995fe3a885e0759722e3b5", "ja": "意外？　いいえ、期待大", "zh": "意料之外？不，万分期待", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "150a53011817d14667c97102f4abe433198065146160177278077ef2145169ca", "ja": "天体公演に新たに加わったふたり、\r\n紬と歌織による『オフィウクス』。\r\n早速多くの仕事が舞い込む中、ふたりは\r\n宣伝も兼ねて、誰が一番投稿を拡散させ\r\nられるかを競うSNS企画に参加することに。", "zh": "新加入天体公演的两人——\n由紬和歌织组成的“蛇夫座”。\n在迅速涌来的众多工作中，两人也兼顾宣传，\n参加了一项比拼谁能让帖子扩散得最广的SNS企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "67c7717fba5280b776899be5628f8eec554e1cb71cf4ffa89017236b11467a47", "ja": "（さて、歌織さんと紬を招集してミーティングだ。\nいい反応が返ってくるといいんだけど……）", "zh": "（那么，把歌织小姐和紬叫来开个会吧。希望能得到积极的回应……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "ec6183f7b42005a4cf72bf57928c47fd7faa733b99df98fb68c21ae36b115148", "ja": "私たちで、天体公演……！", "zh": "由我们来办天体公演……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ec6183f7b42005a4cf72bf57928c47fd7faa733b99df98fb68c21ae36b115148", "ja": "私たちで、天体公演……！", "zh": "由我们来办天体公演……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1035fd8ec423b2499c9e636cef2a836172073bc214e555b4594ac49afa38ef9c", "ja": "ああ、歌織さんと紬のデュオユニットだ。\nどうだろう？", "zh": "啊，是歌织和紬的双人组合。\n怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "37d74c0e283ff76786fc6d04189f5ef01927abde5fee3a475006f2e55327183c", "ja": "どうも何も……。私の気持ちなど、\n言わずとも想像がつきそうなものですが。", "zh": "还问什么……我的心情，不说想必您也能猜到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cd73b77a40aeb0e0f2caedc18e4c61acc109215bd39f50d2c77a9e748a2af353", "ja": "もしかしてあなたは、あえて言わせたいのですか？\nだとしたら、いささか趣味が悪いように思いますが。", "zh": "难不成您是故意想让我说出来吗？\n要是那样的话，我觉得您的品味未免有些恶劣了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "349cb7428f239be610664682815fb017723abfc7ea691516ab55ce2e857fc453", "ja": "い、いや、まずは意思を確認しようと思って……。\nつまり、紬はやってもいいって事なんだな！", "zh": "不、不是，我只是想先确认一下意愿……\n也就是说，紬愿意做对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "a61b0bbbbc0916d8070ab46b1635f54c692174455f20d886015b4edf349fccd6", "ja": "もちろん私も大賛成です。紬ちゃんと\nユニットなんて、とってもワクワクするもの！", "zh": "当然我也非常赞成。能和紬组成组合，真是让人无比期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d3457275b54a47c73cb034cdd65d46e5540a1680a66654888878f9affd46cf2f", "ja": "そう言っていただけてなによりです。\n桜守さんと歌った曲、あるにはありますが……。", "zh": "能听到您这么说，那就再好不过了。虽说确实有一首和樱守小姐一起唱过的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "ef472e9b72fe6f07691cdb1f4acb9c2536ebdce86fd57e6ad2f820d3a1f0332c", "ja": "ええ、アイドルヒーローズジェネシスの時に。\nあれは、劇中のテーマ曲だったものね。", "zh": "嗯，是在偶像英雄创世纪的时候。\n那首歌是剧中的主题曲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "ee905bd7d4b8558d4bfa5914e5f9ef1d401bba7d2dc2176128a22a53b639a058", "ja": "今回は、お互い初めてのデュオユニットだし、\nちょっぴり特別っていうか……。", "zh": "这次我们也是第一次组成双人组合，所以感觉有点特别……算是吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "38609ccbc4ed70ba9f1f36e034d2024dada7c348d5fec0c36cf452b2fa350b11", "ja": "ふふっ……私、もう楽しくなってきちゃったみたい。\nよろしくね、紬ちゃん！", "zh": "呵呵……我好像已经开始期待起来了。\n请多关照，紬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5896add9a871052331c4a45389ec775d43aeab9311678c1a2aee6991e4a9a06f", "ja": "はい、こちらこそ。これを機に、\nもっと桜守さんのことを知れたらと思います。", "zh": "好的，我也是。希望能借此机会，进一步了解樱守小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5ab9b98f2405490a350968e0f881d6b68a3cb34c7fc1aae8b6965d3b86bba4ee", "ja": "それじゃあ早速仕事の話だ。既にコラボとか\nタイアップとか社長が取ってきてくれてて……。", "zh": "那就马上来说说工作的事吧。社长已经帮我们争取到了合作和联动之类的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4e54b39e3ca8f041a21f0f859759866066626e41d59371592a63a6b70ae8d94e", "ja": "どれも魅力的だから引き受けたいんだけど、\n流石に全部はスケジュールが厳しそうなんだ。", "zh": "每个都很有吸引力，我也想全部接下来，但日程安排实在有些吃紧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "1c22af5aa18a389d85ba0b38e6e67867164bf1273edd44b88d25c9efda76d9dc", "ja": "あら？　このピアニストの方、有名な……。\n他にも芸人さんやスポーツ選手もたくさん……。", "zh": "咦？这位钢琴家，好像很有名……\n还有好多艺人和运动员……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e43fe26ba85b3c07c913db6b3b886499c44bec1716a4bf08f5d37969223aa8da", "ja": "それは、SNS企業からの打診ですね。\n『＃バズしか見えないっ！』っていう企画です。", "zh": "那是社交媒体公司发来的邀约。是一个名为“#バズしか見えないっ！”的企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e268fa7ad7529dfdfc9ec7346511ddd5a59c1bf9222c3b3e683f293dd4879cf0", "ja": "バズ……つまり参加者は、SNSで多く\n拡散されるように投稿をするのですか？", "zh": "爆红……也就是说，参加者要在SNS上发布容易被大量转发的内容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "aa869a38b938e46fb10c0c05fc1fd7a2e5c5cf45b73dfef8a568c019ccc7b9c9", "ja": "うん。誰が一番バズれるか競うんだ。優勝したら、\nTVCMとか別媒体でも大きく宣伝してくれるって。", "zh": "嗯。就是要比谁引发的话题度最高。要是能夺冠，\n据说还能在电视广告等其他媒体上也获得大力宣传。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "0cf906f3770a02613d58dd9587ca3fc08b810c47f916930885c43afd0273b35d", "ja": "今はこういうの流行りですものね。\n……これ、いいんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "现在这种活动正流行呢。\n……这个应该不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "23e432d745931196b433096569e6bccb269b0f1b8942e24bcdcfa1ba9cf6cf03", "ja": "そうですね。SNSへの投稿なら、\n仕事の合間に手軽に出来ますし……。", "zh": "是啊。要发到社交平台的话，工作间隙也能轻松完成……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "553c3c2a8b079081d320e3ae3bddd78f25f7d95d1f8ea5c7937853056d81f3dd", "ja": "ユニットの宣伝も兼ねてるし、\n他の仕事への影響も少ないし……アリだと思います。", "zh": "也可以顺便宣传组合，对其他工作的影响也比较小……我觉得可行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6a85f438066ca1e749f86c89209115ad0b28dec836f2a5c2576e3a08cbe10c35", "ja": "SNS玄人の有名人に混じっての参加になりますが、\n打診がきたのは、期待されている証拠と考えれば……。", "zh": "虽然是要和精通SNS的名人们一起参加，\n不过既然对方来试探意向，就说明受到了期待，这样想的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fabb947f5610446992bf6764e4f6d9c69a1719f5763f25e9d164a2ad718a1406", "ja": "……。つまり、あなた自身は\n私たちに期待しているわけではない、と……？", "zh": "……也就是说，您本人并不期待我们……是这个意思吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "27caf60dcd9c08d4dc68d0cd40cf949abbba04ba94f26b637fcf868364c059d7", "ja": "い、いや、ちゃんと期待してるよ！　俺も！", "zh": "不、不是，我当然也对你们抱有期待啊！我也一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "7d7a5a8c1d2241479273a7c363c871fa064642761318d5ca4fb70e622eada021", "ja": "うふふっ。期待されているなら、\n応えるのがアイドル、じゃないかしら？", "zh": "呵呵。既然承蒙期待，\n作为偶像就该予以回应，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b723e4619b7f9bb6511fa5d61e9fcc5d3f9fb9b2a565c4a82146158d1e8a575d", "ja": "確かに……桜守さんの言う通りですね。\n私も覚悟を決めて、お付き合いいたします。", "zh": "确实……正如歌织说的那样。\n我也下定决心，奉陪到底。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "d40ab684922c33c084af0c35d537903a8f429ce8308f4ceb2c8b7d868b0e9756", "ja": "（SNSで知名度もあげれば、他の仕事にもいい影響が\nあるはず。今回はこの企画を軸に、やってみるか！）", "zh": "（如果通过SNS提高知名度，应该也会对其他工作产生积极影响。就以这次企划为核心，试试看吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
